- **`MathPreconditions.java`** — added two private string constants (`MUST_BE_POSITIVE`, `MUST_BE_NON_NEGATIVE`) to deduplicate the same suffix literal repeated across 7 overloads
- **`HostAndPort.java`** — added `"No port is defined"` and `"Port out of range: %s"` messages to two previously bare `checkState`/`checkArgument` calls
- **`MediaType.java`** — added descriptive messages to two bare `checkArgument` calls in the private `normalizeToken` method

